WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.125
- Yar, after killing me, what did ye plan on doing next?

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.166
- You know you don’t have to lean into the whole pirate thing.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:07.125
KENNY, ATTACK!

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.000
What the hell? You’re 43 years old.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:13.791
- Ya best start believing in GOAT stories, Mr. Rodgers.

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:15.041
You’re in one.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:19.125
See, it goes right through me, and that’s the result of a healthy, pliable life.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.666
- I can’t believe Brady took down all three of us legends.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:26.750
- Another uneventful season.

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:30.375
- Look, if you think that you can just waltz in...oh, OK, nevermind.

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:33.916
- YOU’LL ALWAYS REMEMBER THE DAY YOU ALMOST
CAUGHT PATTY MAHOMES!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.541
- [Josh Allen:] Let’s go.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:35.750
- No. I want it to hurt.

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:39.000
- [Travis Kelce:] He could never love me like a No. 1 receiver.

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:40.875
I’m just a lowly tight end…

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.625
Dang, Brady still has a cannon.

00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:45.625
- ♪♪♪ There once was a team 'twas lost at sea ♪♪♪

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.916
♪♪♪ Till there came a man named Tom Brady ♪♪♪

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:50.166
♪♪♪ Ditched Winston, they began to win ♪♪♪

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.250
♪♪♪ Throw less picks, Tom, throw. ♪♪♪
- [Together:] HOOAH!

00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:54.750
♪♪♪ SOON! MAY THE BUCCANEERS WIN ♪♪♪

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.041
♪♪♪ TO REMIND OURSELVES OF JON GRUDEN ♪♪♪

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.291
♪♪♪  SIMMS, GARCIA AND JOSH FREEMAN ♪♪♪

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.291
♪♪♪ JUST LET US HAVE THIS ONE! ♪♪♪

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:03.250
- And you're sure young people like this?

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.416
- [Gronk:] SEA SHANTIES HOT NOW.

00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:06.666
- You better not be messing with me.
I DO NOT WANT TO LOOK OLD—

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:08.375
- Who are you rooting for?

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:09.666
- Oh, I just watch for the commercials.

00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:11.875
- Then welcome to Team State Farm.

00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:17.000
- Argh, come on, that’s DPI.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.666
- Parlay!

00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:21.541
Ok, so I’m going with Evans under 60 yards and Godwin under 70.

00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:23.166
- EXCUSE ME?!
- WHERE DO YOU GET OFF?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.875
- WE’LL NEVER CATCH THEM!
THEIR PIRATE SHIP HAS A FOOTBALL FIELD!

00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:29.166
- We named the monkey Gronk.

00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:34.000
- Curse you, Tom. You'll never get away with going to a
team with an already great offense.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.500
- Hahaha, I started this season on the Jets.

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:39.416
- It’s me, controversial third receiver…

00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:40.625
Scotty Miller!

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:43.916
- Who the hell is that?
- Dude, you’re CLEARLY Julian Edelman in disguise.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.666
- What? No! Why? Did Tom say something? AHH.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:49.625
- DON’T CHASE US, OR I’LL THROW YE ALL IN RONALD JONES’ LOCKER.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.291
- Sup.

00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:52.125
- BIENIEMY’S IN CHARGE OF THE SHIP.

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:53.875
- F--king finally.

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:57.875
- If I win without Belichick, I'll be free of the curse of the system QB.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.916
- Look, they gave me a sword!

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:00.500
- You!

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.166
- [Gronk:] ME?!

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:05.416
- Oh God, did I kill Patrick Mahomes?...I could probably get away with this.

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:09.416
- Don't you see?! I’M THE NEW MAIN FOOTBALL CHARACTER.

00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:11.250
- THIS IS MY LEGACY!

00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.875
- I’M ONLY 25!

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:15.375
- [Kelce:] They know there’s 52 other players on the team, right?

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.125
- Haha, 52.

00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:18.666
- Wait, do you just think any number's funny?

00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:28.125
- Wow, Tom, you made it without me.
I’m…actually so proud of you.

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:31.541
Come. Come here...son.

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.250
No, It’s safe. Let’s hug it out.

